            "detailed_description": "<h1>Try Before You Buy</h1><p>You can download the <strong>free demo</strong> to try Final Days before purchasing.<br><br>Final Days is best experienced in co-op with friends. You can play online, LAN, or local split-screen, and <strong>bots can be added</strong> to fill out your team.<br><br>The demo is fully compatible with the full game, so you can jump into multiplayer sessions together.<br><br>As a solo developer, I really appreciate your support and feedback — feel free to reach out via Steam discussions or Discord.<br><br>— Mike, +7 Software</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><strong>Humanity is on the brink. Mutant hordes are closing in — and survival means fighting together.</strong><br><br><strong>Hold the line. Or get overrun.</strong><br><br>Final Days is a fast-paced co-op twin-stick shooter where you and your team battle overwhelming waves of zombie-like mutants — often <strong>hundreds at a time</strong>. Hold chokepoints, cover each other, and unleash a storm of gunfire and explosions as the pressure builds.<br><br><strong>Fight back against overwhelming hordes — with hundreds of enemies on screen at once.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/c8643dd077372433080c322bcd44fc2e.poster.avif?t=1776350409\" width=428 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/c8643dd077372433080c322bcd44fc2e.webm?t=1776350409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/c8643dd077372433080c322bcd44fc2e.mp4?t=1776350409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tear through relentless hordes, <strong>switch between powerful ammo types</strong>, and use explosives to control the swarm before it overruns you. Every run is a desperate push to survive — whether you're chasing high scores or simply trying to make it through the next wave.<br><br><strong>Control the chaos — or be consumed by it.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/076c356c34085ab98e974683c01491aa.poster.avif?t=1776350409\" width=414 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/076c356c34085ab98e974683c01491aa.webm?t=1776350409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/076c356c34085ab98e974683c01491aa.mp4?t=1776350409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Play solo or jump into co-op with up to <strong>16 players</strong> online, LAN, or local split-screen. Add bots to fill your squad, experiment with different strategies, and see how long your team can hold the line.<br><br><strong>Play solo or fight together — up to 16 players surviving the same onslaught.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/f13ccfce8eab715e0c5b06c14af10e91.poster.avif?t=1776350409\" width=428 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/f13ccfce8eab715e0c5b06c14af10e91.webm?t=1776350409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/f13ccfce8eab715e0c5b06c14af10e91.mp4?t=1776350409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/6d315646e6d50109e07cedc0448402e2.webp?t=1776350409\" width=107 height=30 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Survive overwhelming odds</strong> with hundreds of enemies on screen at once<br></li><li><strong>Play co-op your way</strong> — up to 16 players online or LAN, plus 4-player local split-screen<br></li><li><strong>Add bots</strong> to fill out your squad and keep the action going<br></li><li><strong>Switch ammo types on the fly</strong> and use explosives to control the chaos<br></li><li><strong>Dynamic environments</strong> — move objects to slow the hordes before they break through<br></li><li><strong>Compete for high scores</strong> on leaderboards and unlock achievements<br></li><li><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> by Chris Head<br></li><li><strong>Create and share custom maps</strong>, or play maps made by the community</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/d6d520da72cdfa380364dd6540314e49.webp?t=1776350409\" width=134 height=30 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Campaign: Rendezvous</strong><br>Your base has been overrun. Fight through 7 wave-based maps and reach the extraction point — if you can survive long enough.<br><br></li><li><strong>Campaign: Escape</strong><br>Supplies are gone and the bunker is overrun. Push through procedurally generated levels where every run is different. Can you make it out alive?<br><br></li><li><strong>Campaign: Depths</strong><br>Descend into Site 7 and reclaim the bunker from mutant infestations. Something new lurks deeper below — can you survive it?<br><br></li><li><strong>Last Stand</strong><br>Endless wave-based survival across a wide variety of maps. How long can you hold out against the growing hordes?<br><br></li><li><strong>Eradication</strong><br>Fight through endless procedurally generated bunker levels. The deeper you go, the harder it gets.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>Humanity is on the brink. Mutant hordes are closing in — and survival means fighting together.</strong><br><br><strong>Hold the line. Or get overrun.</strong><br><br>Final Days is a fast-paced co-op twin-stick shooter where you and your team battle overwhelming waves of zombie-like mutants — often <strong>hundreds at a time</strong>. Hold chokepoints, cover each other, and unleash a storm of gunfire and explosions as the pressure builds.<br><br><strong>Fight back against overwhelming hordes — with hundreds of enemies on screen at once.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/c8643dd077372433080c322bcd44fc2e.poster.avif?t=1776350409\" width=428 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/c8643dd077372433080c322bcd44fc2e.webm?t=1776350409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/c8643dd077372433080c322bcd44fc2e.mp4?t=1776350409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tear through relentless hordes, <strong>switch between powerful ammo types</strong>, and use explosives to control the swarm before it overruns you. Every run is a desperate push to survive — whether you're chasing high scores or simply trying to make it through the next wave.<br><br><strong>Control the chaos — or be consumed by it.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/076c356c34085ab98e974683c01491aa.poster.avif?t=1776350409\" width=414 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/459830/extras/076c356c34085ab98e974683c01491aa.webm?t=1776350409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs